WEBVTT

00:03.770 --> 00:06.230
Did we have someone that 
pretty at our academy?

00:05.350 --> 00:07.230
So elegant...

00:06.550 --> 00:08.730
That girl is so beautiful.

00:16.610 --> 00:17.900
Your big sister?

00:18.250 --> 00:20.690
I can't find my big sister!

00:20.690 --> 00:22.780
Then why don't we look for her together?

00:22.780 --> 00:24.230
Really?

00:24.230 --> 00:26.420
My name is Lily White.

00:26.420 --> 00:28.080
And you are?

00:29.360 --> 00:31.790
My name is Tiana Algren!

00:32.450 --> 00:33.530
Algren?

00:35.140 --> 00:36.690
Lily?

00:38.110 --> 00:39.840
It's nothing.

00:39.840 --> 00:41.910
Let's go find your big sister together.

00:41.910 --> 00:42.750
Yes!

00:43.330 --> 00:44.450
She looked over here!

00:44.450 --> 00:45.650
So noble!

00:45.650 --> 00:47.440
So heartwarming!

00:47.440 --> 00:49.190
Ahh!

00:49.190 --> 00:50.680
Amazing...

00:49.190 --> 00:50.680
Lovely...

00:51.460 --> 00:53.960
<i>Maybe I overdid it a bit.</i>

00:55.460 --> 00:56.870
It's my sister!

00:59.830 --> 01:01.860
Big sister!

01:28.940 --> 01:32.690
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

02:31.710 --> 02:35.000
<b>Episode 7
The Girl Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Infiltrates a Sorcery Academy</b>

02:37.050 --> 02:40.020
Thank you for looking 
after my little sister.

02:40.020 --> 02:40.900
Not at all.

02:40.900 --> 02:43.260
Tiana's such a well-behaved little girl.

02:43.260 --> 02:44.670
I haven't introduced myself.

02:44.670 --> 02:46.760
I'm Ariane Algren.

02:46.760 --> 02:49.050
My name is Lily White.

02:49.050 --> 02:51.390
I see, so you're Miss Lily?

02:51.390 --> 02:52.110
Yes.

02:57.160 --> 02:59.560
Why don't I get straight to the point?

03:00.200 --> 03:03.120
You're not one of our students, are you?

03:03.880 --> 03:05.340
No, I'm...

03:06.800 --> 03:09.340
You're very clever, Lady Ariane.

03:09.650 --> 03:12.810
I try to be capable in all things.

03:12.810 --> 03:14.890
Then what academy do you attend?

03:14.890 --> 03:17.570
I will neither run nor hide,

03:17.570 --> 03:19.850
so why don't you also tell the truth?

03:20.580 --> 03:22.630
Then I shall do that.

03:23.760 --> 03:25.850
I'm sorry to have deceived you.

03:25.850 --> 03:28.410
My name is Ray White, and I attend 
the Arnold Academy of Sorcery.

03:28.410 --> 03:29.450
It's nice to meet you.

03:29.450 --> 03:31.650
Wait, wait. What. What?

03:31.650 --> 03:33.190
Is everything all right?

03:33.190 --> 03:35.280
You're a boy?!

03:35.280 --> 03:36.150
Yes?

03:36.150 --> 03:38.240
N-Now just one moment,

03:38.240 --> 03:41.760
because your your body structure and 
muscle tone are unmistakably female...

03:41.760 --> 03:43.060
And then your voice!

03:43.060 --> 03:44.400
What did you do to your voice?

03:44.400 --> 03:48.160
It's an application of inside 
code and a bit of sorcery.

03:48.160 --> 03:49.950
Application?

03:49.950 --> 03:52.150
But Ray White...

03:52.150 --> 03:55.800
I believe that's the name of the very 
first ordinary to attend the academy.

03:55.800 --> 03:57.920
They say you are quite 
accomplished in battle.

03:57.920 --> 04:00.970
I can't believe that rumor 
reached even your academy.

04:00.970 --> 04:02.170
I'm a little embarrassed.

04:03.450 --> 04:05.960
Your appearance and your 
voice are so mismatched,

04:05.960 --> 04:08.170
my head's starting to spin.

04:09.130 --> 04:11.230
I admit I was taken aback,

04:11.230 --> 04:14.490
but it doesn't change the fact 
that you helped my little sister.

04:14.490 --> 04:18.200
I could never stain the Algren name by 
having you leave without a gift of gratitude.

04:20.310 --> 04:24.180
Why don't I show you what 
they call royal style?

04:27.250 --> 04:29.590
Good luck to you both!

04:30.080 --> 04:33.280
I thank you for the proposed 
mock battle, Miss Algren.

04:34.110 --> 04:36.200
Please call me Ariane.

04:36.500 --> 04:39.860
Are you sure? We did just meet.

04:39.860 --> 04:41.280
I'm making a special exception.

04:41.280 --> 04:42.370
Then, I am much obliged.

04:42.370 --> 04:44.220
I'd like you to call me Ray, as well.

04:44.810 --> 04:47.230
Once again, it's nice to meet you.

04:47.510 --> 04:49.490
The pleasure is mine, Ariane.

04:50.580 --> 04:53.240
Could you change your voice back?

04:53.730 --> 04:55.970
That discrepancy is just...

04:55.970 --> 04:56.720
Oh.

04:57.180 --> 04:58.220
Understood.

05:20.680 --> 05:22.600
That was spectacular, Ariane.

05:24.500 --> 05:26.530
My big sister is amazing!

05:29.900 --> 05:31.650
You're welcome.

05:32.610 --> 05:35.090
Bye-bye! See you later!

05:35.090 --> 05:36.800
Bye-bye!

05:37.750 --> 05:40.250
Tiana is such a good kid.

05:40.250 --> 05:42.040
I'm sure she will grow up to be

05:42.040 --> 05:44.770
an elegant and beautiful person who 
is loved by all, just like you.

05:45.450 --> 05:46.540
What is it?

05:46.540 --> 05:49.190
N-Nothing at all!

05:49.190 --> 05:52.150
Are you always saying things 
like that to girls?

05:52.150 --> 05:55.610
I've been taught to always compliment women.

05:57.040 --> 05:59.800
You really are strange.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.920
Really?

06:01.390 --> 06:04.880
You will not be participating 
in the Magic Chevalier?

06:04.880 --> 06:06.160
For multiple reasons.

06:06.390 --> 06:09.100
Right now I am a member 
of the organizational staff,

06:09.100 --> 06:12.150
but I also help my friend train.

06:12.150 --> 06:13.830
A friend?

06:14.910 --> 06:15.920
It's Amelia.

06:17.370 --> 06:18.510
Amelia?

06:18.510 --> 06:20.070
Do you mean Amelia Rose?

06:20.070 --> 06:20.820
Yes.

06:21.400 --> 06:24.360
So you came all the way here for her?

06:24.360 --> 06:25.330
That's right.

06:26.860 --> 06:30.690
So I guess she was able to 
make a friend like you.

06:31.320 --> 06:33.070
She is getting strong.

06:33.070 --> 06:36.020
She will win first place 
in the rookie bracket.

06:36.020 --> 06:38.820
You are going to learn 
what defeat tastes like.

06:40.720 --> 06:42.160
I look forward to that.

06:46.760 --> 06:49.190
<i>It's gotten really late.</i>

07:01.050 --> 07:02.230
Are you all right?

07:02.230 --> 07:03.640
I-I'm so sorry!

07:03.640 --> 07:04.640
I...

07:06.100 --> 07:07.670
Are you hurt?

07:10.870 --> 07:12.020
Is something wrong?

07:12.400 --> 07:13.840
I-I'm fine!

07:13.840 --> 07:15.370
Thank you so much!

07:15.700 --> 07:16.960
Not at all.

07:16.960 --> 07:21.390
It would be tragic if 
your snow white skin was marred.

07:23.380 --> 07:25.440
Goodbye, then.

07:27.720 --> 07:28.630
Oh?

07:30.750 --> 07:34.130
W-Won't you please tell me your name?

07:34.980 --> 07:37.300
My name is Lily White.

07:37.300 --> 07:40.270
Big Sister Lily!

07:40.270 --> 07:41.650
And your name is?

07:41.650 --> 07:44.390
I-I'm Maria Bradley.

07:45.210 --> 07:46.740
Bradley...?

07:46.740 --> 07:48.900
Are you Rebecca's younger sister?

07:49.240 --> 07:51.590
You know my older sister?

07:51.590 --> 07:52.600
I do.

07:52.600 --> 07:55.200
Rebecca has helped me out greatly.

07:55.200 --> 08:00.020
I... I was having doubts about coming 
to this school, but not anymore!

08:00.020 --> 08:03.270
If you're here, I will definitely 
enroll next year!

08:03.270 --> 08:05.280
Please wait for me!

08:06.330 --> 08:07.630
Is that so?

08:07.630 --> 08:10.790
Then, I'll be going now.

08:10.790 --> 08:13.290
I'm looking forward to seeing you again.

08:25.340 --> 08:26.980
Here you go.

08:29.000 --> 08:30.480
Thank you.

08:30.480 --> 08:31.890
Private Amelia!

08:31.890 --> 08:33.550
Looks like you're working hard!

08:34.040 --> 08:35.130
Ranger!

08:35.130 --> 08:37.230
Reporting for another day of training!

08:39.200 --> 08:41.210
Thank you, Eris and Claris!

08:41.210 --> 08:44.920
But, Amelia, make sure you stay focused.

08:45.630 --> 08:47.220
That voice...

08:47.220 --> 08:48.310
Ray?

08:48.770 --> 08:51.220
Why is Ray's voice coming 
from that beautiful girl?

08:51.960 --> 08:53.360
Oh, sorry.

08:53.360 --> 08:54.920
I just came back from my mission.

08:54.920 --> 08:55.730
It's me.

08:57.530 --> 09:00.230
What?!

09:05.240 --> 09:06.860
Look at that! It's so amazing!

09:06.860 --> 09:08.240
The scenery is so beautiful.

09:08.240 --> 09:09.950
You seem to be having fun today.

09:09.950 --> 09:11.790
Well, obviously!

09:11.790 --> 09:14.220
Seriously, that training is hell.

09:14.220 --> 09:17.050
But, I am really nervous.

09:17.050 --> 09:19.240
N-No-Not me!

09:19.510 --> 09:20.590
Don't worry.

09:20.590 --> 09:22.110
My master is a good person.

09:23.270 --> 09:25.900
Have you been well, Ray?!

09:25.900 --> 09:27.510
Have you gotten even taller?

09:27.510 --> 09:30.260
You always say that, but I haven't.

09:30.260 --> 09:31.920
Yeah, you're right.

09:31.920 --> 09:34.370
So are these them?

09:34.370 --> 09:38.580
Yes. My irreplaceable friends 
I met at the academy.

09:39.170 --> 09:41.280
I'm Evi Armstrong.

09:41.280 --> 09:44.820
Ray and I share a dorm room and 
we've gotten really close.

09:44.820 --> 09:46.740
I'm Lydia Ainsworth.

09:47.140 --> 09:49.810
But hmm...

09:49.810 --> 09:50.810
You're big.

09:51.970 --> 09:53.320
You can tell?

09:53.320 --> 09:55.070
Keep it up.

09:55.070 --> 09:57.580
And I'd like you to become 
good friends with Ray.

09:57.580 --> 09:58.780
Naturally!

09:59.070 --> 10:02.670
I'm... I'm Elisa Griffith.

10:02.670 --> 10:04.610
I'm a half-elf.

10:04.960 --> 10:05.910
I see.

10:07.040 --> 10:09.960
You're big, too, in another sense.

10:09.960 --> 10:10.710
Huh?

10:11.040 --> 10:14.480
I like how adorably clueless you are.

10:15.590 --> 10:19.180
Um, well. Erm...

10:19.180 --> 10:22.310
I'm a huge fan of your work!

10:22.310 --> 10:24.340
May I... May I have your autograph?

10:25.620 --> 10:27.450
Carla, do you have a pen?

10:27.450 --> 10:29.070
Yes. Right here.

10:34.250 --> 10:37.140
M-My name is Claris Cleveland.

10:39.980 --> 10:41.700
Ugh, why...

10:42.890 --> 10:45.320
I heard you want to become a hunter.

10:45.320 --> 10:47.570
How do you know that?

10:47.570 --> 10:50.140
I know the head of the Cleveland house.

10:50.140 --> 10:52.390
He came to me for advice a while back.

10:52.390 --> 10:54.350
Oh, really?

10:56.380 --> 10:58.460
I'm a platinum hunter.

11:00.290 --> 11:02.900
Unfortunately, now I'm like this.

11:04.130 --> 11:06.740
That's the first time I've seen a real one.

11:06.740 --> 11:08.550
With that said,

11:08.550 --> 11:11.510
there's no reason why you 
can't become a hunter,

11:11.510 --> 11:13.550
just because you're a girl or the 
daughter of a noble house.

11:14.220 --> 11:17.460
What's important is taking that first step.

11:22.730 --> 11:25.720
I'm Amelia Rose. It's been a long time.

11:25.720 --> 11:29.070
Yes, we've met each other at a few parties.

11:29.070 --> 11:29.710
Yes.

11:29.710 --> 11:32.030
I'd like to talk to you in private.

11:32.030 --> 11:32.700
Come this way.

11:33.620 --> 11:35.220
O-Of course.

11:37.790 --> 11:38.890
Master Ray,

11:40.700 --> 11:42.520
could you please help me?

11:46.410 --> 11:49.630
I heard something rather concerning.

11:50.750 --> 11:54.230
They say that the Empire's angels 
of death have started moving again.

11:54.230 --> 11:55.770
The Grim Reapers.

11:56.290 --> 11:58.980
What is the Aywell Empire's 
death squad up to?

11:58.980 --> 12:01.360
I haven't heard that much.

12:01.820 --> 12:04.480
But the timing does concern me.

12:05.310 --> 12:07.410
You mean the Magic Chevalier?

12:07.410 --> 12:08.260
That's right.

12:08.260 --> 12:11.720
All of the noble families will 
come together for that event.

12:11.720 --> 12:14.240
Please keep that in mind.

12:14.240 --> 12:15.360
Understood.

12:16.920 --> 12:18.680
You seem worried about something.

12:18.680 --> 12:19.960
Isn't that so, Amelia Rose?

12:19.960 --> 12:22.750
What do you mean?

12:23.890 --> 12:25.810
These are letters from Ray.

12:25.810 --> 12:28.660
At first, he was just reporting his status.

12:28.660 --> 12:31.220
But lately... well.

12:32.220 --> 12:34.010
Well... what?

12:34.400 --> 12:38.050
He knows that you have hidden 
something away in your heart,

12:38.050 --> 12:40.360
but apparently, he doesn't know if 
he is allowed to find out what.

12:41.530 --> 12:43.520
You know about Ray's past, correct?

12:43.520 --> 12:45.030
I do.

12:45.030 --> 12:46.990
He has talent.

12:46.990 --> 12:50.720
He's the world's best sorcerer, 
and easily surpasses me.

12:50.720 --> 12:54.420
I've taught him as much 
sorcery knowledge as I can,

12:54.420 --> 12:56.800
but there was one thing that 
I could not teach him.

12:58.120 --> 12:59.590
The human heart.

13:00.250 --> 13:02.360
The human... heart.

13:03.040 --> 13:04.890
When I first met Ray,

13:04.890 --> 13:08.060
he was like a kid who had given 
up on everything in this world.

13:08.060 --> 13:09.830
It took some time,

13:09.830 --> 13:12.440
but we managed to get him back bit by bit.

13:12.440 --> 13:16.820
But even then, the only people 
around him then were us soldiers.

13:17.430 --> 13:20.300
That's why I recommended 
that he join the academy.

13:20.300 --> 13:22.200
I hoped that there,

13:22.200 --> 13:25.720
he could develop his heart and 
find himself valuable friends.

13:26.730 --> 13:29.190
And today, you all came.

13:30.270 --> 13:32.870
Ray is worried about you.

13:32.870 --> 13:35.590
He's picking up on subtle 
clues about human emotions.

13:35.590 --> 13:38.130
That makes me so incredibly happy.

13:38.540 --> 13:40.050
Miss Lydia...

13:40.050 --> 13:41.210
Amelia Rose.

13:41.620 --> 13:45.360
I don't know what you have in your heart.

13:45.360 --> 13:47.900
Nobody does, except for you.

13:48.280 --> 13:51.480
You are welcome to keep what is in it 
a secret for the rest of your life.

13:52.190 --> 13:55.840
But if you really wish to change yourself,

13:55.840 --> 13:57.240
trust your friends.

13:58.000 --> 14:00.100
Please trust in him.

14:05.740 --> 14:07.160
All right, everyone!

14:07.160 --> 14:08.730
Change into your swimsuits!

14:09.470 --> 14:11.240
I've been waiting for this.

14:11.240 --> 14:13.070
We're going swimming, Ray!

14:13.340 --> 14:15.480
Yay!

14:17.860 --> 14:21.090
Today was a lot of fun.

14:21.090 --> 14:23.000
Thanks for inviting me.

14:23.000 --> 14:25.620
Knowing you enjoyed it is 
all the thanks I need.

14:26.000 --> 14:30.350
Lydia is a good person and 
Carla's cuisine was delicious.

14:30.350 --> 14:32.010
No complaints here!

14:32.400 --> 14:33.750
But...

14:34.020 --> 14:36.720
I wasn't expecting Miss Abbie 
and Carol to show up.

14:37.220 --> 14:39.390
That was... amazing.

14:46.620 --> 14:48.440
She's getting there.

14:49.190 --> 14:53.700
<i>Ray, in your letters you asked what 
you ought to do about Amelia.</i>

14:54.150 --> 14:58.380
Like I did for you, 
do what you can for her.

14:58.380 --> 15:01.480
Whatever you yourself want to do for her.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.320
I will, Master.

15:03.750 --> 15:04.930
Roll call!

15:04.930 --> 15:06.410
One!

15:06.410 --> 15:08.500
Good, everyone's here!

15:08.500 --> 15:10.230
This day has finally come.

15:10.230 --> 15:13.660
Private Amelia, let me reward you 
with the highest of compliments.

15:13.660 --> 15:14.580
Ranger!

15:14.580 --> 15:15.920
Thank you!

15:15.920 --> 15:19.740
And now we will commence with the final 
examination of the Ainsworth-style boot camp!

15:19.740 --> 15:20.640
Ranger!

15:20.640 --> 15:22.600
If you manage to pass the exam,

15:22.600 --> 15:24.550
I shall grant you this Ranger badge.

15:26.950 --> 15:28.100
Now, Private Amelia,

15:28.100 --> 15:31.700
make the petals of the 
rose on my chest scatter!

15:32.590 --> 15:34.040
Don't worry.

15:34.040 --> 15:35.770
I won't unleash my powers.

15:36.890 --> 15:40.510
Amelia, I know how strong you are.

15:41.410 --> 15:42.660
Ray...

15:48.590 --> 15:49.890
Let the examination begin!

15:50.440 --> 15:52.410
Ranger!

15:55.060 --> 15:58.340
And here we are at this 
year's Magic Chevalier.

15:58.610 --> 16:02.600
All of you who stand before me are brave 
fighters who have fought to be here,

16:02.600 --> 16:05.850
and to ultimately attain the glory of 
being the strongest student sorcerer.

16:06.580 --> 16:08.850
If you want to master sorcery,

16:08.850 --> 16:11.010
it requires not just talent and hard work,

16:11.010 --> 16:14.860
but also an environment where 
healthy competition is fostered.

16:15.180 --> 16:18.360
This tournament is certainly going 
to be a good stepping stone for you.

16:18.880 --> 16:21.620
I hope that you will give 
it everything you have.

16:21.990 --> 16:25.810
With this, I proclaim the 
Magic Chevalier open!

16:33.860 --> 16:34.940
Amelia.

16:38.570 --> 16:39.670
Ariane.

16:40.030 --> 16:42.760
It's been a while since we spoke like this.

16:43.830 --> 16:45.520
That's true.

16:46.550 --> 16:49.480
You seem to have changed a bit.

16:49.480 --> 16:51.410
You think so?

16:51.410 --> 16:55.130
It seems that I really 
wasn't the right one...

16:55.130 --> 16:55.830
Huh?

16:59.430 --> 17:01.780
I'll be waiting for you in the final round.

17:02.560 --> 17:04.800
Right. We'll meet again in the final round.

17:09.880 --> 17:11.790
And just like that,

17:11.790 --> 17:13.920
it's time for the semi-finals of the 
Magic Chevalier's rookie bracket!

17:13.920 --> 17:16.730
I, Dina Sera, will continue 
to provide live coverage.

17:16.730 --> 17:20.270
As a commentator, I have Miss 
Carol Caroline with me.

17:20.270 --> 17:21.020
Wink!

17:21.610 --> 17:23.940
And now, let me introduce our competitors.

17:26.920 --> 17:30.600
From the Mercross Academy of 
Sorcery, Shine Girard.

17:33.860 --> 17:37.520
From the Arnold Academy of Sorcery, Amelia Rose.

17:37.520 --> 17:39.150
Amelia!

17:39.540 --> 17:40.760
You got this!

17:40.760 --> 17:43.670
You got this!

17:41.010 --> 17:42.360
Amelia!

17:42.360 --> 17:43.660
Good luck!

17:44.450 --> 17:46.170
Show them, Amelia!

17:46.550 --> 17:48.450
Good luck, Amelia.

17:48.780 --> 17:51.790
I, Abbie Garnet, will be 
acting as the referee.

17:51.790 --> 17:54.260
A player wins when they have pushed 
their opponent out of the ring,

17:54.260 --> 17:56.540
or if they scatter the rose 
from the other participant's chest.

17:56.840 --> 18:02.980
The match can also be ended if I determine 
that the bout should not go on.

18:02.980 --> 18:04.050
Are you both ready?

18:04.490 --> 18:05.310
I am.

18:05.310 --> 18:06.720
Come get it!

18:07.070 --> 18:08.320
Begin!

18:22.940 --> 18:24.040
It's over!

18:24.040 --> 18:25.960
The winner is Amelia Rose!

18:27.180 --> 18:29.460
Th-The match is over!

18:29.460 --> 18:34.280
Amazingly, Rose only needed one 
spell to deliver the deciding blow!

18:34.280 --> 18:35.960
That was a well-executed delay.

18:36.360 --> 18:39.800
The moment the match began,

18:39.800 --> 18:43.020
Amelia planted an activated 
spell in the ground.

18:43.020 --> 18:45.550
Then she just needed to 
lure her prey over it,

18:46.000 --> 18:48.070
and boom!

18:48.070 --> 18:50.080
That is some very difficult 
sorcery right there,

18:50.080 --> 18:52.680
so it's amazing how well 
Amelia pulled it off!

18:52.680 --> 18:53.700
Yes!

18:53.700 --> 18:54.500
Wow!

18:54.500 --> 18:56.300
She just crushed him.

18:56.300 --> 18:59.580
There's no doubt that she'll win it all!

19:01.300 --> 19:02.950
Where are you going, Ray?

19:03.570 --> 19:05.450
I have some organization staff work to do.

19:14.080 --> 19:14.960
Ray.

19:14.960 --> 19:17.060
It's time, Albert.

19:18.390 --> 19:19.580
I see.

19:26.550 --> 19:27.760
I wish you a good fight.

19:29.200 --> 19:31.340
Yeah, I'm off.

19:36.920 --> 19:41.470
Next up, we have a match between 
the Diom Academy of Sorcery's Ariane Algren

19:41.470 --> 19:45.990
and the Arnold Academy 
of Sorcery's Albert Alium.

19:46.550 --> 19:49.370
Ariane! Ariane! Ariane!

19:49.370 --> 19:51.880
Go! Fight!

19:51.880 --> 19:53.140
Begin!

19:59.430 --> 20:01.420
Impressive sword play from both sides!

20:01.600 --> 20:04.880
This is a straight clash of power on power!

20:13.180 --> 20:15.900
And now the match has shifted 
heavily to one side.

20:15.900 --> 20:17.460
I suppose this is what you can expect

20:17.460 --> 20:19.840
from the eldest daughter of 
the great house of Algren.

20:19.840 --> 20:20.960
Probably!

20:20.960 --> 20:21.860
Al...

20:26.140 --> 20:28.120
You won't surrender?

20:28.120 --> 20:30.030
It would be dangerous to continue.

20:30.350 --> 20:33.260
I'm well aware.

20:33.260 --> 20:37.420
The old me would have 
given up a long time ago.

20:37.420 --> 20:38.760
But you know...

20:39.060 --> 20:42.630
Once we are aware, 
we can start anything over.

20:43.070 --> 20:46.670
You're the only one who can provide 
yourself with the answer you seek.

20:46.670 --> 20:50.050
...my heart will not accept defeat!

20:53.770 --> 20:55.440
Got you!

21:01.270 --> 21:02.420
Prepare yourself!

21:04.260 --> 21:05.960
Lightning Strike!

21:12.450 --> 21:13.500
It's over!

21:13.500 --> 21:15.720
The winner is Ariane Algren.

21:16.580 --> 21:18.870
And the match is over!

21:18.870 --> 21:22.460
With an overwhelming blow, 
Algren has secured her victory.

21:22.460 --> 21:24.740
It was literally a show of force!

21:24.740 --> 21:26.350
I can't wait for the final round!

21:27.960 --> 21:30.360
I'm bursting with excitement.

21:34.210 --> 21:35.420
Oh.

21:36.710 --> 21:40.520
I didn't even notice how 
beautiful the sky is today.

21:41.570 --> 21:43.290
Was that for real?

21:43.290 --> 21:45.440
So she's going to be 
fighting against Amelia?

22:05.800 --> 22:10.550
M-Miss Caroline, what are you doing?!

22:10.550 --> 22:12.720
Hello, spectators!

22:13.050 --> 22:18.910
I'll be singing a song to get us all 
in the mood for the final round.

23:24.340 --> 23:28.240
You know, I also have 
nights when I get lonely.

23:28.860 --> 23:30.800
I know what you mean, Abbie.

23:30.800 --> 23:33.030
Oh, where is Miss Carol?

23:34.280 --> 23:37.380
Erryone, let's just cut loose!

23:37.380 --> 23:38.970
This is bad! Everyone run!

23:38.970 --> 23:39.350
Ah?

23:39.350 --> 23:39.710
Ih?

23:39.710 --> 23:40.110
Uh?

23:40.110 --> 23:40.540
Eh?

23:40.540 --> 23:42.570
Oh!

23:44.870 --> 23:46.280
Are you all okay?!

23:46.280 --> 23:48.730
Don't look!

23:50.030 --> 23:54.990
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

23:50.030 --> 23:54.990
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:50.030 --> 23:54.990
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:50.410 --> 23:52.020
This is the preview of the next episode

23:52.020 --> 23:54.260
of <i>The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World</i>!

23:54.990 --> 23:58.790
Amelia's heart wavers in light 
of Ariane's overwhelming power!

23:58.790 --> 24:02.280
But life is never considerate and 
brings in an unexpected guest.

24:02.280 --> 24:05.490
"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest 
Sorcerer Inspires the Rose"!

24:05.500 --> 24:10.010
<b>Episode 8
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Inspires the Rose</b>

24:06.670 --> 24:09.240
This was Carol Caroline. Wink!
